            <div xml:id="d219">

                <pb facs="0351" n="339" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg339"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00115A PW/5–2945.: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bern</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-05-29T20:00:00+01:00">May 29, 1945—8
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received May 29—6:05 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2941. American Interests—Far East. Dept’s 1736, May 7. Gorgé replies he already
                    made several representations Japs in effort obtain remedial action but these
                    brought no result. Has strongly intervened with Minister Togo basis reference
                    telegram.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harrison</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
